        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, in September 2025, we announced a new agreement with Patheon Manufacturing Services, LLC, part of Thermo Fisher Scientific (collectively, \"Thermo Fisher\") to provide custom commercial fill-finish capacity for our broad-spectrum PCVs at Thermo Fisher's Greenville, North Carolina facility.",
