        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In consideration of the commercial supply services and Lonza’s other obligations under the agreement, we will pay Lonza a daily fee for Lonza’s operation of the facility solely to actively manufacture the components.",
