        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "On February 18, 2026, we entered into a development and manufacturing services agreement with Lonza, effective as of January 1, 2026, pursuant to which Lonza will perform manufacturing process development and commercial manufacture and supply of certain key components for our proprietary PCV franchise.",
        "start_character": 122509,
        "end_character": 122812
